    "updated_at": "2016-02-03T12:36:37Z",
    "body": "We did discuss this, and `SharedWorker` has a similar problem. We had not considered treating redirects as a network error. That would be possible, but also seems very surprising.\n\n(Note that a registry probably does not want to use permanent redirects.)\n",
