    "created_at": "2016-02-03T17:47:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-03T17:47:16Z",
    "body": "If we decided here that we would not follow redirects and treat that as an error, the service worker problem would not automatically disappear. There is a bit of debate though whether the browser always uses the response URL to resolve URLs or the last request URL. What we do would depend on that as well.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
