    "body": "I'm certainly not pushing for implementation changes, I just felt this needed to be brought up somewhere, and for myself as well to confirm the consequences. I guess this is a little more pressing since `export *` can't be used for these redirections due to it skipping the `default`, which is unfortunate.\n\nA custom resolve hook effectively then remains the best way to handle redirection from a module perspective as far as I can tell.\n",
