    "created_at": "2016-02-03T19:01:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-03T19:01:56Z",
    "body": "> But please be aware that work is being made for the loader spec to support this\n\nIf the loader spec introduces shells, I don't think it will be acceptable to implementers. You can't just break HTTP semantics like that.\n",
